@startuml
!include ../iris-style.puml
title D-17  Manuscript processing: upload to searchable passages
caption From apps/documents/tasks.py, apps/ai/tasks.py, CELERY_TASK_ROUTES and ADR-052, ADR-054, ADR-056, ADR-058 on main (IR-1021).

|Author|
start
:Upload the manuscript PDF;
|Django (backend)|
:Check it is a real PDF with at least one page\nand at most 50 MB (validators, IR-665);
:Save the Version and its file;
:Read the review text on campus with pdfplumber\n(no AI, every Version, ADR-058);
|celery-extraction|
:extract_manuscript_text;
if (Embargo released and Contact person\nanswered Yes to AI use? (ADR-052, ADR-054)) then (yes)
  :Admit the paid call when provider\nadmission is enforced (ADR-041);
  |LlamaParse|
  :Parse the PDF into structure;
  |celery-extraction|
  :Store PdfExtraction and Figures;
else (no)
  :Stop: nothing leaves campus;
  stop
endif
|celery-default|
:chunk_extraction: labelled-structure chunks\n(voyage-context-4 tokens, ceiling 700);
:Swap in the new ChunkSet atomically;
|celery-embedding|
:embed_chunk_set;
|Voyage AI|
:Contextualized chunk embeddings;
|celery-embedding|
:Store ChunkEmbedding (pgvector, HNSW);
:generate_record_overview\n(needs a summary model);
|AI runtime|
:Search, read and cite the passages\nfor readers who may read the paper;
stop
@enduml
